{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AbWHGV2fuE1795572648.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋該區。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨。今晚清涼。吹和緩至清勁北至東北風，初時高地間中吹強風。<br/><br/>展望: 明早仍然清涼。隨後一兩日漸轉天晴乾燥，氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:42:55.692537+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:15.410506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:36:06.174422+00:00","content_hash":"8ce352f548784340ebf2c098c2c55e431af9f69406accaeae292fa9948b0732b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:42:55.692537+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}